msgid "Choisir un compte propre"
msgstr "Choose your own account"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/monnaies_changelist_before.html:78
msgid ""
"Compte manquant : l'export comptable sera refusé tant que ce compte manque."
msgstr ""
"Missing account: the accounting export will be refused as long as this "
"account is missing."

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/monnaies_changelist_before.html:82
msgid "Choisir un compte"
msgstr "Choose an account"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/monnaies_changelist_before.html:90
msgid "Le lieu n'accepte aucune monnaie."
msgstr "The venue does not accept any currency."

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:23
msgid "À quoi servent les comptes des moyens de paiement ?"
msgstr "What are the payment method accounts for?"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:26
msgid ""
"Pour chaque façon de payer, cette page dit dans quel tiroir arrive l'argent."
msgstr "For each way of paying, this page tells which drawer the money goes into."

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:29
msgid "espèces → 530000, la caisse ;"
msgstr "cash → 530000, the till;"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:30
msgid "carte bancaire → 512100, l'argent du terminal de paiement ;"
msgstr "card → 512100, the money from the payment terminal;"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:31
msgid "chèque → 511200, les chèques à déposer à la banque ;"
msgstr "check → 511200, the checks to deposit at the bank;"

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:32
msgid ""
"paiement en ligne → 517100, le compte Stripe : l'argent attend d'être viré à "
"la banque."
msgstr "online payment → 517100, the Stripe account: the money is waiting to be transferred to the bank."

#: Administration/templates/admin/comptable/moyens_changelist_before.html:34
msgid ""
"Un cadeau (offert) ou un paiement en points n'a pas de tiroir : aucun argent "
"n'arrive."
msgstr "A gift (free of charge) or a payment in points has no drawer: no money comes in."

